{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49935","headline":"苏幙遮 · 吕岩","name":"苏幙遮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天不高，地不大，惟有真心，物物俱含载。\n不用之时全体在，用即拈来，万象周沙界。\n虚无中，尘色内，尽是还丹，历历堪收采。\n这个鼎鑪解不解，养就灵乌，飞出光明海。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}